---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /proekti/
title: Проекти
description: Реализирани проекти на ДМД Комфорт — дограма, щори и обръщане за апартаменти, къщи и офиси.
---

<section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-deeper via-ink to-brand-dark pb-16 pt-32 text-white">
  <div class="container-site">
    <div class="eyebrow text-brand before:bg-brand">Портфолио</div>
    <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl font-display text-[clamp(2.75rem,6vw,4.5rem)] font-black leading-none">Нашите проекти</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70">Примерни обекти — пълни страници с описание, материали и резултат.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad bg-brand-mist">
  <div class="container-site grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    {% for p in projects %}
      <a class="card reveal group block no-underline" href="{{ ('/proekti/' + p.slug + '/') | url }}">
        <div class="relative m-3 aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
          <img class="image-cover" src="{{ p.images[0] }}" alt="{{ p.title }}" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-ink/10 px-5 pb-6 pt-4">
          <div class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-brand">{{ p.location }} · {{ p.objectType }}</div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 font-display text-xl font-extrabold text-ink group-hover:text-brand">{{ p.title }}</h2>
          <p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">{{ p.shortDescription }}</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
